1 NOTE 1760 Robert was born on 21st December 1760 In Ealing, Middlesex to Robert and Elizabeth.
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1761 He was baptised on 16th January1761 at St Mary's Church.
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1792 On 15th January 1792 Robert (32)  married Elizabeth Arrowsmith (22) from Cripplegate in Middlesex. Their children included:
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1793 Eliza
2 CONT 1795 Robert John
2 CONT 1797 Samuel
2 CONT 1798 Thomas Allen
2 CONT 1801 Hannah
2 CONT 1804 Mary
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1841 By the time of the 1841 census Robert (80) and Elizabeth (70) were living on their own in Erith, Kent and Robert's Occupation is recorded as "Independant" (Living by his own means). 
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1849 Robert died January 1849 and Elizabeth in February of the same year.
