1 NOTE 1812 Eliza is born on 2/12/1812 and appears to have been baptized twice. Once on 25/12/1812 and then again 24/1/1813.
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1839  On the 20/5/1839 Eliza married George Coleman, the owner of the Elmley Ferry Inn in Murston Kent. She was 27 years old.
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1841 In the 1841 census she is with George at the Elmley Ferry Inn with various family members including daughter Louisa who was just eight months old.
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1851 Her husband George died in 1849 and in the 1851 census it can be seen that Eliza has taken over the running of the Elmley Ferry Inn. She is there as Licenced Victualler with various family members and lodgers. One of the lodgers is Robert Watt
2 CONC s - whom she marries two months after the census,
2 CONT 
2 CONT SEE ROBERT WATTS NOTES 1851 - 1881
2 CONT 
2 CONT 1885 Eliza died on 6th April 1885 from Bronchitis. At the time of her death she was living with her husband Robert at 98 William Street, Milton.
