1 OBJE @O129@
1 NOTE Dear Robert,  I am wondering if Giuseppe Luccioni in your family tree is my grandfather? I know little about him other than he was born in the Borgo Vercelli, Italy in 1872, married my grandmother May Luccioni in London in 1928 and died in 1935. M
2 CONC y mother, Pauline Luccioni was 7 years old when he died. He was a head waiter in large hotels in London and also Southend. He was 63 years old when he died in 1935 and is buried in the Roman Catholic poriton of Streatham Park Cemetery.  Carol Stone
