1 NOTE Jesse Rutland was a policeman when he married his wife Harriet Seager on the 5th of March 1842. His Father was John Rutland and he was a Labourer. Jesse was a Policeman according to the marriage certificate. The town was Newcut which is in London s
2 CONC outh of Waterloo Station. Harriet Seager was the Daughter of Edward Seager and he was a shipwright.
