1 NOTE Ivy did not live at  home from the time she was about 15. Until she was married she worked for most part as a parlour maid in a largish establishment in Sutton, Surrey.  She had a viperish tongue and was quite a jealous person.  She eventually marr
2 CONC ied Arthur Palmer, a widower who was some years older than herself. On his retirement they moved to Seamer, near Scarborough.
