1 NOTE Harry was employed at the Wouldham Cement Works all of his working life. He lived at home with his mother and younger brother, Percy.  Although he never married he had a fiancee, Doll White, for about 45 years until the day he died.  He used to mee
2 CONC t with her on Wednesdays and at weekends. It was said that they had both agreed not to marry until their respective mothers had died but when this finally happened they then agreed it was all too late!
