1 NOTE An energetic little lady (about 5 ft tall) who, following the death of her husband, raised 7 sons and 2 daughters on her own on a state pension.  A strict disciplinarian Jane was known to use the cane on her son Ben after he returned from the Firs
2 CONC t World War because he came home late one evening! Although she ruled the house with a rod of iron she was a good Mother, Mother-in-Law and Grandmother.  She read the woman's magazine Red Letter, enjoyed the cinema once per week (her favourite acto
2 CONC r being John Boles) and went on outings with the West Thurrock Womens Guild.
