1 _DSCR The photo was certainly taken by me, as I can remember taking it!  It is of Barrie, our mother (Ethel, or ‘Budge’), and her uncle (David Dand).  He was an interesting bachelor great-uncle to Barrie and me, and often visited us in Dorking from Fores
2 CONC t Gate.  I believe he worked as an assistant accountant in a gold mine in South Africa for quite a few years, after fighting in the Boer War.            Sue Shorthose (Hayes)
